<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : gsir3538_BBT</h1>
<div><p>Se testează adăugarea unui produs</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc28013"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P233-10: AdaugareProdusTestcase1-ECP&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">gsir3538</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se adauga un produs nou folosind variabile valide. Cu ajutorul variabilelor, un produs nou este salvat in sistem.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ol>
	<li>id: int &amp; id &gt;= 0</li>
	<li>pret: double &amp; pret &gt; 0 &amp; pret &lt;= 10000</li>
	<li>nume: string &amp; len(nume) &gt; 0 &amp;&nbsp;len(nume) &lt;= 255</li>
	<li>tip: TipBautura &amp; exista in sistem</li>
	<li>categorie: CategorieBautura &amp; exista in sistem</li>
</ol>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceEcpBvaTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceEcpBvaTest#assertAddCase</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">gsir3538_F01:  AdăugareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
